            <strong style="color:#e4e4e7;">Prompt:</strong> Full body concept art portrait of Khải Đăng, a male Memory Hunter in his late 20s to early 30s, standing in a futuristic dystopian city of Neo-Veridia. He has a lean, agile build and an intense, focused expression, with eyes conveying deep thought and a hint of weariness from constant mental battles. His outfit is a blend of cyberpunk and modern &apos;Wuxia&apos; practicality: a dark, sleek, form-fitting inner suit, covered by a tactical, subtly armored vest and a long, flowing but durable dark grey or deep teal trench coat. The coat features subtle, integrated LED lines that glow faintly with a cool blue or purple hue, pulsing intermittently as if linked to his neural activity. He wears high-tech, fingerless gloves with visible neural interface ports on the fingertips, and sturdy, reinforced combat boots with thick soles. A high collar on his coat partially obscures his lower face, adding to his mysterious aura and protecting him from data noise. The background features shimmering data streams, towering, dark futuristic skyscrapers, and distant neon lights of Neo-Veridia, suggesting a blend of physical and virtual space. He is in a vigilant, slightly dynamic pose, perhaps with one hand slightly raised as if sensing data, or gently touching his temple where hidden neural interface ports are located. The overall aesthetic is gritty, high-tech, and slightly melancholic, emphasizing intricate details and a sense of silent power. Photorealistic, cinematic lighting, volumetric fog, intricate details, 8K resolution, rendered in Unreal Engine 5, concept art style.
            
